  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added `camcraft_geometry::boundary_chains::join_open_runs` to deduplicate XY-coincident open runs regardless of direction and weld touching runs end to end. Single-point and non-finite runs pass through unchanged so operation generation refuses them by name.\n- Called `join_open_runs` on `chains` in `selection_geometry_impl` (`crates/app/src/operation/selection.rs`) for `OpParams::Contour`, `OpParams::PlasmaProfile`, and `OpParams::WireContour`.\n- Added `pub fn offset_run_side` in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/contour_run_side.rs` and re-exported it in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/mod.rs`. Both `contour_run_side::offset_run` and `crates/app/src/operation/contour_open.rs` (`offset_run`) now call it.\n- Filtered `Region::sweep` loops to one outer CCW loop so inner CW holes from bridged bottleneck notches do not abort the offset.\n- Added `corner_sector_left` for acute convex join arcs wrapping past 90 deg, `CAP_TIE` (`0.006 mm`) for arc-sag tie-breaking, and `nearest_on_run` clearance checks before inserting perpendicular `normal_at` endpoints on short inside-corner legs.\n- Added decision record `docs/decisions/2277-contour-inside-corners.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\n- `stitch_open_runs` only closes full rings into `loops`, so manually picked open contour edges remained separate runs. Offsetting each run on its own drove the tool across inside corners into adjacent walls (`Z 0.000 near (40.000, 10.995)` on the U-notched block).\n- On connected open chains, `offset_run` rejected inner CW holes across bridged bottleneck notches, misclassified acute convex join arcs with `cross`, added swallowed `normal_at` endpoints on short legs, and lost end-cap intersections within Clipper2's `5 um` arc sag.\n- `crates/app/src/operation/contour_open.rs` carried a duplicate `offset_run` with the same defects.\n\n## Tests\n\n### Pins\n\n- `camcraft-geometry` (`8 passed; 0 failed` in `boundary_chains`, new unit test):\n  - `boundary_chains::tests::join_open_runs_welds_out_of_order_and_deduplicates_coincident_runs`\n- `camcraft-motion` (`11 passed; 0 failed` in `contour_run_side`; 3 pins failed on unchanged `upstream/main`):\n  - `machining2d::contour_run_side::tests::an_open_run_with_a_short_leg_at_an_inside_corner_stops_clear`\n  - `machining2d::contour_run_side::tests::an_open_run_with_a_bottleneck_notch_bridges_the_mouth`\n  - `machining2d::contour_run_side::tests::an_open_run_with_sharp_or_filleted_inside_corner_and_acute_turn_leaves_tool_radius`\n- `camcraft-app` (`6 passed; 0 failed` in `contour_open_side`; 4 pins failed on unchanged `upstream/main`):\n  - `u_notch_picked_open_edges_turn_inside_corners`\n  - `filleted_inside_corner_smaller_than_tool_radius_succeeds_as_open_runs`\n  - `acute_inside_corner_and_oversized_tool_succeed_open_and_closed`\n  - `a_contour_open_boundary_with_a_short_inside_corner_leg_stops_clear`\n\n### Mutations\n\n- Reverting `join_open_runs` in `crates/app/src/operation/selection.rs`: 3 pins failed in `contour_open_side`; restoring passed 6/6.\n- Reverting `offset_run` in `crates/app/src/operation/contour_open.rs`: 1 pin failed in `contour_open_side`; restoring passed 6/6.\n- Reverting CCW loop filtering in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/contour_run_side.rs`: 1 pin failed in `contour_run_side`; restoring passed 11/11.\n- Removing `corner_sector_left`: 3 pins failed in `contour_run_side`; restoring passed 11/11.\n- Bypassing `clear` on `normal_at` endpoints: 1 pin failed in `contour_run_side`; restoring passed 11/11.\n- Bypassing `CAP_TIE`: 1 pin failed in `contour_run_side`; restoring passed 11/11.\n\n### Gate and Clippy\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` (858 batch test and lint steps across crate runs): `geometry` 15/15, `kernel` 14/14, `cl` 5/5, `tools` 6/6, `post` 86/86, `sim` 81/81, `motion` 94/94, `ui` 23/23, and `clippy -D warnings` 1/1 passed. `app` passed 532/533 steps.\n- `app suites: microarc_test_part` failed `a_wrapped_op_on_the_test_part_posts_wrapped_a` (`wrap_rotary_parallel_microarc4.nc: line count 3246 != 3245`). That failure is pre-existing on `upstream/main` (`983f527bd`, upstream `post-merge` run `44258092076` from PR #2386 commit `eba0e477d`).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-geometry -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\n- None (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Batch-excluded slow binaries (`motion:finish3d`, `motion:pivot5d`, `motion:flow`, `app:center_cut_multiaxis`) and release-mode suites did not run locally.\n- Interactive mouse edge picking in the UI viewport did not run directly; integration tests pass `GeoSel::edge` picks through `App`.\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- `crates/app/src/operation/selection.rs`: PR #2484, PR #2433, and PR #2256 touch different functions (`drive_chains`, `selection_geometry_in`) than `selection_geometry_impl`. Whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `crates/motion/src/machining2d/mod.rs`: PR #2460 and PR #2149 touch different exports and modules than `offset_run_side`. Whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nChangelog: fix(2d): join picked open contour runs and fix inside-corner offsetting (#2277)\n\nFixes #2277\n",
